            <div class="section-heading">
                <span class="eyebrow">Source control?</span>
            </div>
            <span>
                GitHub repo: <a class="source-link" href="https://github.com/aaliyahfiala42/SwissTrails" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        github.com/aaliyahfiala42/SwissTrails
            </a>
